{"unit_id": "tag:02G7:proof", "translation": "第（2）项由第（1）项和引理<REF_0001>推出。\n下面证明第（1）项。\n我们先用《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0002>。\n该引理表明，若<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>的有限（finite）可分（separable）域（field）扩张（extensions）的谱（spectra）的不交并（disjoint union），则<MATH_0003>是非分歧（unramified）的。\n反过来，设<MATH_0004>是非分歧（unramified）的。\n由《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0003>可知，对每个<MATH_0005>，剩余域（residue field）扩张（extension）<MATH_0006>是有限（finite）且可分（separable）的。\n由于<MATH_0007>是局部拟有限（locally quasi-finite）的（引理<REF_0004>），<MATH_0008>的所有点（points）都是孤立闭点（isolated closed points），见引理<REF_0005>。\n因此<MATH_0009>是离散（discrete）空间（space），特别地，它是其各局部环（local rings）的谱（spectra）的不交并（disjoint union）。再由《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0006>可知，这些局部环（local rings）都是域（fields），结论得证。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "separable", "target_term": "可分"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "extensions", "target_term": "扩张"}, {"source_term": "spectra", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "disjoint union", "target_term": "不交并"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "residue field", "target_term": "剩余域"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "separable", "target_term": "可分"}, {"source_term": "locally quasi-finite", "target_term": "局部拟有限"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "isolated closed points", "target_term": "孤立闭点"}, {"source_term": "discrete", "target_term": "离散"}, {"source_term": "space", "target_term": "空间"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "spectra", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "disjoint union", "target_term": "不交并"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "fields", "target_term": "域"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "首次引用的章节名称"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "限制域扩张的次数"}, {"source_term": "separable", "target_term": "可分", "context": "与有限性并列限制域扩张"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "指扩张前后的代数对象"}, {"source_term": "extensions", "target_term": "扩张", "context": "这些扩张的谱组成不交并"}, {"source_term": "spectra", "target_term": "谱", "context": "对应各域扩张"}, {"source_term": "disjoint union", "target_term": "不交并", "context": "要求各谱两两不交"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧", "context": "正向推出的性质"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧", "context": "逆向论证的假设"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "逆向论证所引章节"}, {"source_term": "residue field", "target_term": "剩余域", "context": "逐点考察的域"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张", "context": "指所显示的剩余域扩张"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "该剩余域扩张的有限性"}, {"source_term": "separable", "target_term": "可分", "context": "该剩余域扩张的可分性"}, {"source_term": "locally quasi-finite", "target_term": "局部拟有限", "context": "用于推出各点孤立且闭的条件"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点", "context": "概形上的所有点"}, {"source_term": "isolated closed points", "target_term": "孤立闭点", "context": "同时断言孤立性和闭性"}, {"source_term": "discrete", "target_term": "离散", "context": "描述空间的拓扑"}, {"source_term": "space", "target_term": "空间", "context": "承载离散拓扑的对象"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "对应各点并用于取谱"}, {"source_term": "spectra", "target_term": "谱", "context": "此处对各局部环取谱"}, {"source_term": "disjoint union", "target_term": "不交并", "context": "由局部环的谱组成"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "证明末尾再次引用的章节"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "证明末尾判定为域的环"}, {"source_term": "fields", "target_term": "域", "context": "对这些局部环的判定"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02G3:prose-0004", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下述引理将非分歧（unramified）态射（morphisms）刻画为具有非分歧（unramified）纤维（fibres）的局部有限型（locally of finite type）态射（morphisms）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧", "context": "被刻画的态射的性质"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "被刻画的一类对象"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧", "context": "刻画中对纤维的要求"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "逐纤维描述的对象"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "刻画中对态射的局部要求"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "满足刻画中条件的一类对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02G8:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>若<MATH_0002>是非分歧（unramified）的，则对任意<MATH_0003>，域（field）扩张（extension）<MATH_0004>是有限（finite）且可分（separable）的。\n<STRUCT_0003>若<MATH_0005>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的，且对每个<MATH_0006>，纤维（fibre）<MATH_0007>都是<MATH_0008>的有限（finite）可分（separable）域（field）扩张（extensions）的谱（spectra）的不交并（disjoint union），则<MATH_0009>是非分歧（unramified）的。\n<STRUCT_0004>若<MATH_0010>是局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）的，且对每个<MATH_0011>，纤维（fibre）<MATH_0012>都是<MATH_0013>的有限（finite）可分（separable）域（field）扩张（extensions）的谱（spectra）的不交并（disjoint union），则<MATH_0014>是G-非分歧（G-unramified）的。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "separable", "target_term": "可分"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "separable", "target_term": "可分"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "extensions", "target_term": "扩张"}, {"source_term": "spectra", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "disjoint union", "target_term": "不交并"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示"}, {"source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "separable", "target_term": "可分"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "extensions", "target_term": "扩张"}, {"source_term": "spectra", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "disjoint union", "target_term": "不交并"}, {"source_term": "G-unramif