{"unit_id": "tag:02G3:prose-0005", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下面用对角（diagonal）态射（morphism）来刻画非分歧（unramified）态射（morphisms）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角", "context": "修饰用于刻画的态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "用于刻画的对角态射"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧", "context": "待刻画的态射的性质"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "待刻画的一类对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02GE:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为一态射（morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>若<MATH_0002>是非分歧（unramified）的，则对角（diagonal）态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>是开浸入（open immersion）。\n<STRUCT_0003>若<MATH_0004>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的，且<MATH_0005>是开浸入（open immersion），则<MATH_0006>是非分歧（unramified）的。\n<STRUCT_0004>若<MATH_0007>是局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）的，且<MATH_0008>是开浸入（open immersion），则<MATH_0009>是G-非分歧（G-unramified）的。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "G-unramified", "target_term": "G-非分歧"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理设定的对象"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧", "context": "第一项的假设"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角", "context": "指定第一项中的关联态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第一项结论中的对角态射"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "第一项对对角态射的结论"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "第二项的局部有限性假设"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "第二项中的浸入条件"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧", "context": "第二项的结论"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示", "context": "第三项的局部有限表示假设"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "第三项中的浸入条件"}, {"source_term": "G-unramified", "target_term": "G-非分歧", "context": "第三项结论中带 G 前缀的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02GE:proof", "translation": "第一项由《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0001>推出。\n第二项是因为<MATH_0001>是对角（diagonal）态射（morphism）的余法（conormal）层（sheaf）（引理<REF_0002>），所以若<MATH_0002>是开浸入（open immersion），它显然为零（zero）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "conormal", "target_term": "余法"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "zero", "target_term": "零"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "证明第一项所引引理的章节"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角", "context": "指定所取余法层的态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所取余法层的对象"}, {"source_term": "conormal", "target_term": "余法", "context": "指定层的种类"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "所显示对象的种类"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "推出该层为零的条件"}, {"source_term": "zero", "target_term": "零", "context": "在开浸入条件下该层为零"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02GF:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。\n设<MATH_0002>。\n置<MATH_0003>。\n假设<MATH_0004>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的（相应地为<SPACE_0001>局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）的）。\n下列条件等价（equivalent）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>具有非分歧（unramified）性质（相应地为<SPACE_0002>G-非分歧（G-unramified）性质），该性质在<MATH_0006>处成立。\n<STRUCT_0003>纤维（fibre）<MATH_0007>在<MATH_0008>上于<MATH_0009>处是非分歧（unramified）的。\n<STRUCT_0004><MATH_0010>-模（module）<MATH_0011>为零（zero）。\n<STRUCT_0005><MATH_0012>-模（module）<MATH_0013>为零（zero）。\n<STRUCT_0006><MATH_0014>-向量空间（vector space）<MATH_0015>为零（zero）。\n<STRUCT_0007>有<MATH_0016>，且域（field）扩张（extension）<MATH_0017>是有限（finite）且可分（separable）的。\n<STRUCT_0008>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧"}, {"source_term": "G-unramified", "target_term": "G-非分歧"}, {"source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "zero", "target_term": "零"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "zero", "target_term": "零"}, {"source_term": "vector space", "target_term": "向量空间"}, {"source_term": "zero", "target_term": "零"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "separable", "target_term": "可分"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的起点和终点"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理设定的映射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "第一种局部假设"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示", "context": "分别对应的另一种局部假设"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "所列条件之间的逻辑关系"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第一项逐点考察的对象"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧", "context": "第一项与有限型假设对应的性质"}, {"source_term": "G-unramified", "target_term": "G-非分歧", "context": "第一项与有限表示假设对应的性质"}, {"source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "第二项在给定点考察的对象"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧", "context": "第二项对纤维的要求"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "第三项中所显示对象的种类"}, {"source_term": "zero", "target_term": "零", "context": "第三项中的模为零"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "第四项中所显示对象的种类"}, {"source_term": "zero", "target_term": "零", "context": "第四项中的模为零"}, {"source_term": "vector space", "target_term": "向量空间", "context": "第五项中所显示对象的种类"}, {"source_term": "zero", "target_term": "零", "context": "第五项中的向量空间为零"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "第六项中扩张的代数对象"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张", "context": "第六项中所显示的域扩张"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "第六项对扩张次数的要求"}, {"source_term": "separable", "target_term": "可分", "context": "第六项对扩张可分性的要求"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02GF:proof", "translation": "注意，若<MATH_0001>在<MATH_0002>处是非分歧（unramified）的，则<MATH_0003>在<MATH_0004>的某个邻域（neighbourhood）内成立，这是由定义和第<REF_0001>节中关于微分（differentials）模（modules）的结果得出的。因此，第（1）项推出第（3）项，也推出第（5）项中右侧的向量空间（vector space）为零（vanishing）。\n第（1）项也推出第（2）项，因为由引理<REF_0002>可知，微分（differentials）模（module）<MATH_0005>（对应纤维（fibre）<MATH_0006>在<MATH_0007>上的情形）是微分（differentials）模（module）<MATH_0008>（对应<MATH_0009>在<MATH_0010>上的情形）的拉回（pullback）。关于微分（differentials）模（modules）的这一事实还推出第（4）项中所列的向量空间（vector spaces）等式（equality）。由引理<REF_0003>可知，模（modules）<MATH_0011>和<MATH_0012>都是有限型（finite type）的。因此，模（modules）<MATH_0013>和<MATH_0014>均为零（zero），当且仅当第（4）项中相应的<MATH_0015>-向量空间（vector space）为零（zero），这是由中山引理（Nakayama's Lemma）（《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0004>）得出的。这特别表明，第（3）、（4）和（5）项等价（equivalent）。\n<MATH_0016>的支集（support）在<MATH_0017>中是闭（closed）的，见《模（Modules）》中的引理<REF_0005>。假设（3）意味着<MATH_0018>不在该支集（support）中。因此<MATH_0019>在<MATH_0020>的某个邻域（neighbourhood）内为零（zero），这就推出第（1）项。将第（1）项与第（3）项的等价性（equivalence）应用于<MATH_0021>，即得第（2）项与第（4）项的等价性（equivalence）。至此已知第（1）至（5）项等价（equivalent）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n也可用《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0006>更直接地得出第（1）至（5）项的等价性（equivalence）。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n第（1）项与第（6）项的等价性（equivalence）由引理<REF_0007>推出。这也可由《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0008>和<REF_0009>更直接地推出。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "differentials", "target_term": "微分"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "vector space", "target_term": "向量空间"}, {"source_term": "vanishing", "target_term": "为零"}, {"source_term": "differentials", "target_term": "微分"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "differentials", "target_term": "微分"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "differentials", "target_term": "微分"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "vector spaces", "target_term": "向量空间"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "zero", "target_term": "零"}, {"source_term": "vector space", "target_term": "向量空间"}, {"source_term": "zero", "target_term": "零"}, {"source_term": "Nakayama's Lemma", "target_term": "中山引理"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "support", "target_term": "支集"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "support", "target_term": "支集"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "zero", "target_term": "零"}, {"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价性"}, {"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价性"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价性"}, {"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价性"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧", "context": "证明开头在给定点的假设"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域", "context": "所显示的局部结论成立的范围"}, {"source_term": "differentials", "target_term": "微分", "context": "所引章节讨论的模的种类"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "所引章节讨论的对象"}, {"source_term": "vector space", "target_term": "向量空间", "context": "第（5）项右侧的对象"}, {"source_term": "vanishing", "target_term": "为零", "context": "由第（1）项推出的消失结论"}, {"source_term": "differentials", "target_term": "微分", "context": "拉回后所得模的种类"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "拉回后所得的对象"}, {"source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "第一个微分模所对应的对象"}, {"